re"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(M_0,M_1)\">\\(M=(M_0,M_1)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_a=\\pi_8(M_0)\">\\(q_a=\\pi_8(M_0)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_r=\\pi_9(M_0)\">\\(q_r=\\pi_9(M_0)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(r\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\{q_a,q_r\\}\">\\(q\\in\\{q_a,q_r\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HPState}_{M,w}(q)\\coloneqq\\{r\\in\\mathbf2^*:\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,|r|\\}\\to\\operatorname{RConf}_M\\;\n[\\rho(0)=C_M^0(w)\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(|r|))=q\\land\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|r|-1\\}\\;\\rho(j)\\xrightarrow{r(j)}_M\\rho(j+1)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HPState}_{M,w}(q)\\coloneqq\\{r\\in\\mathbf2^*:\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,|r|\\}\\to\\operatorname{RConf}_M\\;\n[\\rho(0)=C_M^0(w)\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(|r|))=q\\land\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|r|-1\\}\\;\\rho(j)\\xrightarrow{r(j)}_M\\rho(j+1)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{HPState}_{M,w}(q_a),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{HPState}_{M,w}(q_r),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{HP}_{M,w}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}\\cup\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{HPState}_{M,w}(q_a),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{HPState}_{M,w}(q_r),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{HP}_{M,w}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}\\cup\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>接受与拒绝状态均无后继，所以该定义自动排除“停机后再补随机位”的重复计数。对给定 r，逐步确定性使配置轨迹至多一条。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-random-coin-machine","status":"resolved","id":"772657e2b19db9ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-random-coin-machine]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M=(M_0,M_1)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"q_a=\\pi_8(M_0)","display":false},{"tex":"q_r=\\pi_9(M_0)","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\{q_a,q_r\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HPState}_{M,w}(q)\\coloneqq\\{r\\in\\mathbf2^*:\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,|r|\\}\\to\\operatorname{RConf}_M\\;\n[\\rho(0)=C_M^0(w)\\land\\pi_1(\\rho(|r|))=q\\land\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|r|-1\\}\\;\\rho(j)\\xrightarrow{r(j)}_M\\rho(j+1)]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{HPState}_{M,w}(q_a),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{HPState}_{M,w}(q_r),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{HP}_{M,w}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}\\cup\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}.","display":true}],"bytes":1607,"backlinks":[{"id":"49440e374bb38c72","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$、$\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)$ 与 $w\\in\\Sigma^*$；$\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}$、$\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}$ 采用 [[73-df-random-halting-prefixes]]。$t,m\\in\\mathbb N$；上确界在扩展非负实数 $[0,+\\infty]$ 中取，有限空和为零。$A_{M,w},R_{M,w},H_{M,w}$ 及其上确界均显式依赖固定 $M,w$。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-304","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-random-halting-prefixes|随机运行的最短停机比特前缀]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["772657e2b19db9ce"]}